Load `AGENTS.md` first (Canonical Task Flow, core principles, backwards-compatibility rule), then `CLAUDE.md` for project facts.

Use minimal context. For a code change load:
1. `docs/ai/task-router.md`
2. `docs/ai/architecture-manifest.md`
3. `docs/ai/module-ownership-map.md`
4. `docs/ai/file-index/repository-map.md`
5. related tests
6. target files

Strict TDD for behaviour changes: write failing tests first (`error:` > `edge:` > `regression:` > `happy:`) and run `bun run tdd:red` before touching workspace `src/` logic (`docs/ai/testing-strategy.md` "Strict TDD").
Update `docs/ai/file-index/repository-map.md` and the matching `docs/ai/*` maps after a code change (`docs/ai/handoff.md`).
